WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:11.374
"It's true," Jane says. "There is slime here."

2
00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:19.461
"I knew it," Pip says. "June didn't lie!"

3
00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:25.428
The kids wave to the knight.

4
00:00:25.429 --> 00:00:27.855
Just then—

5
00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:32.563
splash! New slime monsters pop

6
00:00:32.564 --> 00:00:38.314
up. A few grab the

7
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:42.064
boat. Pip tries to slap them

8
00:00:42.065 --> 00:00:50.624
away. "Ew! They are sticky like

9
00:00:50.625 --> 00:01:02.209
glue." "I will rescue you," the knight

10
00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:07.453
yells. He blows a big blue gum

11
00:01:07.454 --> 00:01:12.760
bubble. It zips to the

12
00:01:12.761 --> 00:01:20.232
kids. "Grab the bubble!" he

13
00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:27.278
says. The kids grab onto the

14
00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:35.776
bubble. It flies them to the knight.

15
00:01:35.777 --> 00:01:42.863
"Phew! We're safe!" Jane says.

16
00:01:42.864 --> 00:01:47.771
Pip smiles. "Thank you!"

17
00:01:47.772 --> 00:01:53.207
The knight kneels. "Princess Jane, Prince Pip.

18
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:59.996
I am Blue Ralph the Bubble Gum Knight."

19
00:01:59.997 --> 00:02:04.623
"Do you know June?" Jane asks.

20
00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:10.023
"Yes. She went to find you," Ralph says.

21
00:02:10.024 --> 00:02:14.167
"A slime hand got her!" Pip says.

22
00:02:14.168 --> 00:02:19.458
Ralph gasps. "This is bad news."

23
00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:22.968
"We think she is here now," Jane says.

24
00:02:22.969 --> 00:02:26.708
"We have a clue."

25
00:02:26.709 --> 00:02:33.013
Jane shows Ralph the wand.

26
00:02:33.014 --> 00:02:40.566
Ralph looks upset. "The duke got June too!"

